<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/organizations/canlab> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r7950bb065a0f55ae31c944e4_n24fbad77fa874c3c8afd77b377a503feb2 .
