<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/organizations/canlab> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/influenced_by> _:r7950bb065a0f55ae31c944e4_n24fbad77fa874c3c8afd77b377a503feb4 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/organizations/canlab> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/name> "Cognitive and Affective Neuroscience Lab" .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/organizations/canlab> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/part_of> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/organizations/pbs> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/organizations/canlab> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/short_name> "CANlab" .
