<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/doi-10-1162-imag-a-00032> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:rfddbccaa77e19bdbb20eae14_n9a2536b933ec4e4bb2e423b322b5e1c9b7 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/doi-10-1162-imag-a-00032> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:rfddbccaa77e19bdbb20eae14_n9a2536b933ec4e4bb2e423b322b5e1c9b10 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/doi-10-1162-imag-a-00032> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:rfddbccaa77e19bdbb20eae14_n9a2536b933ec4e4bb2e423b322b5e1c9b8 .
