_:r1147c74cfd2fe23c5029aa27_n262e2637156145d389399b1c1aa8ff6bb7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "<p> <a href=\"https://github.com/pyout/pyout/\">pyout</a> is a Python package that defines an interface for writing structured records as a table in a terminal. It is being developed to replace custom code for displaying tabular data in in <a href=\"#dandi\">DANDI client</a> and others. </p>" .
