_:r7e9290d50905c2ee10c835ee_ne5e3967b39ea4e8094ae700516787961b12 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Neurologist, neuroimaging methods guru, early proponent of reproducible practice and in-depth understanding of the used analysis methodologies, lead of <a href=\"http://www.nipy.org\">Neuroimaging in Python</a> community and some of its popular software (<a href=\"http://www.nipy.org/nipy\">NiPy</a> and <a href=\"http://www.nipy.org/nibabel\">NiBabel</a>) projects and infrastructural solutions, such as <a href=\"https://github.com/nipy/nibotmi\">Nibotmi</a> which we are contributing to." .
