_:r9929e1239119568888c4c9af_n95fe3f4463f343fc9099793e07756346b7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Aims to facilitate neuroimaging data sharing by providing an out-of-the-box solution including consent forms enabling anonymized data deposition and anonymization tools/pipelines. An international effort with GDPR compliance materials." .
