_:r9932725f33a24a7f2ee43414_n5f123fd7734f40b19829896df8d3eab5b1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:r9932725f33a24a7f2ee43414_n5f123fd7734f40b19829896df8d3eab5b1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "MyKrok" .
