_:rb8167730e0d59309de03d5ed_nf73d461b756f47598ec9643e6649d079b9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "A former lead software engineer of <a href=\"https://brainlife.io\">brainlife.io</a>. He helped us save both COVID-times virtual OHBMs. A hacker who likes coding, cooking, bicycling, hiking, gardening, and just about anything else." .
