_:rb834464da77613ea571d66df_n6444d444f7f742949c79c7fda2e45928b14 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:rb834464da77613ea571d66df_n6444d444f7f742949c79c7fda2e45928b14 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "A reproducible and generalizable software workflow for analysis of large-scale neuroimaging data collections using BIDS Apps" .
