_:rb8ce4759263aedf0c619b26c_n1323a70339a0483c9d2a88d9a5e4a8c3b10 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Start> .
_:rb8ce4759263aedf0c619b26c_n1323a70339a0483c9d2a88d9a5e4a8c3b10 <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/at_time> "2019-04-18"^^<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/w3ctr-datetime> .
_:rb8ce4759263aedf0c619b26c_n1323a70339a0483c9d2a88d9a5e4a8c3b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/section> .
_:rb8ce4759263aedf0c619b26c_n1323a70339a0483c9d2a88d9a5e4a8c3b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:rb8ce4759263aedf0c619b26c_n1323a70339a0483c9d2a88d9a5e4a8c3b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Software" .
_:rb8ce4759263aedf0c619b26c_n1323a70339a0483c9d2a88d9a5e4a8c3b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/description_html> .
_:rb8ce4759263aedf0c619b26c_n1323a70339a0483c9d2a88d9a5e4a8c3b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:rb8ce4759263aedf0c619b26c_n1323a70339a0483c9d2a88d9a5e4a8c3b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "<p> <a href=\"https://github.com/ReproNim/containers\">ReproNim/containers</a> is a <a href=\"#datalad\">DataLad</a> dataset providing a ready-to-use \"distribution\" of containerized neuroimaging environments (Singularity images) for reproducible analysis. It collects a curated set of containers — including those used by <a href=\"#heudiconv\">HeuDiConv</a> and the broader <a href=\"http://repronim.org\">ReproNim</a> ecosystem — and exposes them via the <code>///repronim/containers</code> DataLad dataset path, making it trivial to pin and share exact software environments alongside data and workflows. </p>" .
_:rb8ce4759263aedf0c619b26c_n1323a70339a0483c9d2a88d9a5e4a8c3b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/title> .
