_:rc01ee80777c48f29667b7891_ne19732220c1c43e3a7181e0183a1254db7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "OHBM 2020 posters" .
_:rc01ee80777c48f29667b7891_ne19732220c1c43e3a7181e0183a1254db8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/description_html> .
_:rc01ee80777c48f29667b7891_ne19732220c1c43e3a7181e0183a1254db8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:rc01ee80777c48f29667b7891_ne19732220c1c43e3a7181e0183a1254db8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "<p> <a href=\"https://datalad-datasets.github.io/ohbm2020-posters/\">OHBM 2020 posters</a> was a centralized registry of posters and their <a href=\"https://jitsi.org\">Jitsi</a> rooms for <a href=\"https://www.humanbrainmapping.org\">OHBM</a> 2020, the first edition held entirely online. The conference had no working way for an attendee to find a poster and walk up to its author; this gave it one, as a browsable catalogue backed by a <a href=\"/projects#datalad_\">DataLad</a> dataset. Twenty-three people contributed to it in the weeks around the meeting. <a href=\"https://github.com/datalad-datasets/ohbm2020-posters\">Archived</a> since 2022: it did its job for the meeting it was built for. </p>" .
_:rc01ee80777c48f29667b7891_ne19732220c1c43e3a7181e0183a1254db9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> .
_:rc01ee80777c48f29667b7891_ne19732220c1c43e3a7181e0183a1254db9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:rc01ee80777c48f29667b7891_ne19732220c1c43e3a7181e0183a1254db9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "A centralized registry of posters and their Jitsi rooms for OHBM 2020, the first edition held entirely online. The conference had no working way for an attendee to find a poster and walk up to its author; this gave it one, as a browsable catalogue backed by a DataLad dataset. Archived since 2022: it did its job for the meeting it was built for." .
_:rc04ecfaf1048a46ea9eacd79_n18ffb19265d84b8c9fd9979e575558f9b1 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <https://scicrunch.org/resolver/RRID:SCR_002630> .
