_:rc04ecfaf1048a46ea9eacd79_n18ffb19265d84b8c9fd9979e575558f9b11 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
