_:rc04ecfaf1048a46ea9eacd79_n18ffb19265d84b8c9fd9979e575558f9b9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/description_html> .
