_:rcb22ac7865255391ba1a6419_nc392162205674195b3aed43d2860fcceb2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Command for downloading build logs, artifacts, and release assets for a GitHub repository. Supports GitHub Actions, Travis-CI.com, and Appveyor with optional DataLad control for backup and distribution." .
