_:rd5783ea9f8c3dce62070c919_n4efe36b43a6e44f9b64d34056015dea4b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/section> .
