_:re6eac3cf5c6bc4914af8f314_n44bdd0875c82467baad42a03df75e2aeb14 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "A data management platform that adapts open-source software distribution models to address data-sharing limitations. Provides a versatile data management platform using git-annex for large data tracking built on Git." .
