_:rf8e8ad7fe48222651af600ce_n1386e630217c4d4f9ad18490746c8873b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Dr. Haxby for many years directed the <a href=\"https://www.dartmouth.edu/dbic/\">Dartmouth Brain Imaging Center (DBIC)</a> and the <a href=\"https://www.dartmouth.edu/ccn//\">Center for Cognitive Neuroscience (CCN)</a> and cradled many of the CON projects. Dr.Haxby has an outstanding history of developing and disseminating in the open novel research methodologies, as well as influential datasets." .
